{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53758","headline":"悼故妓 · 李播","name":"悼故妓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"直应人世无风月，始是心中忘却时。\n（见《白氏长庆集》卷三五《对酒有怀寄李十九郎中》自注引）（按：李十九即李播，从郁贤皓先生《唐刺史考》卷一三一《蕲州》考证。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李播","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53758.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53758","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}